      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property returns a value in the range `0.0` to `1.0`, with `0.0` representing the minimum volume, and `1.0` representing the maximum volume.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 `0.0`에서 `1.0` 범위의 값을 반환하며, `0.0`은 최소 볼륨, `1.0`은 최대 볼륨을 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "0ba59e5e755a75b7e651eee31acf0290337c76e69469e70797ad8f73be7c632f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Only the user can directly set the system volume.",
      "ko": "시스템 볼륨은 사용자만 직접 설정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d175381dcbce1b1abf4b293a9f8b54931ae08fef622b562b960d6974990e2051",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Provide a volume control in your app, using [`MPVolumeView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MediaPlayer/MPVolumeView), to provide the interface to adjust the system volume.",
      "ko": "앱에서 [`MPVolumeView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MediaPlayer/MPVolumeView)를 사용해 시스템 볼륨을 조정할 수 있는 인터페이스를 제공하려면 볼륨 제어를 추가해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2d42669bb3c96f422369d747bcb7ca8730c58c2829835b5952e01ca8d9a2a270",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "You can observe changes to the value of this property by using [`Key-value observing`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/General/Conceptual/DevPedia-CocoaCore/KVO.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/TP40008195-CH16).",
      "ko": "[`Key-value observing`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/General/Conceptual/DevPedia-CocoaCore/KVO.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/TP40008195-CH16)을 사용해 이 속성 값의 변경을 관찰할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "47da5a83da773d962520c3e46021bc316b71ae5cdc03f5147ad85efb7db525db",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
